    lint-one-file, interpreter, 291, 3645845, 2026-09-12T05:45:08Z, ee2a35f717f71be5f50608257b34bc6745db668d6335723fdb0065f24a130367, "wave baseline 2026-09-12; target src/lib/common/net/oid.spl; the interpreter lane is 96 physical files smaller than default: a default-lane number is the one an import fix must move"
